				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/835/981/042/973/496/original/832faf6af375b9a6.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-28T15:58:49.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Ha! Yeah, I guess from a capital and finance perspective it is very reflective of a zero interest rate era :D</p><p>Never would have guessed it would impact open source web development frameworks ;-p</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
