			"date": "2023-08-28T16:13:59.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@kixxauth\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>kixxauth</span></a></span> I can very much recommend this episode from Tech Won't Save Us: <a href=\"https://techwontsave.us/episode/180_abolish_venture_capital_w_edward_ongweso_jr\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">techwontsave.us/episode/180_ab</span><span class=\"invisible\">olish_venture_capital_w_edward_ongweso_jr</span></a></p><p>TLDR; Venture Capital is a plague on society that keeps on festering and intends to infiltrate all parts of human living, to commodify the most mundane parts of it.</p>",
