			"date": "2023-08-28T17:06:40.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Touché 🙇🏼‍♂️ I chose Astro since it made it easy to incrementally move my old PHP and Sass site to something a bit more modern. In my case, that also means, if I ever do anything more with it, it’ll be a more elaborate rewrite. Thus I’d consider switching libraries / static site generators.</p>",
