			"date": "2023-08-28T18:15:09.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> everybody wants to crack the WordPress hegemony. They just haven’t found the right combination of frontend/backend/cms yet. </p><p>No monetization strategy we know of is a bad look for Astro. Sad, because their community and contributors are great. Their Discord is super lively but moderated really well and very helpful. Their docs are super helpful and thorough.</p>",
