			},
			"date": "2023-08-28T23:19:14.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@developit\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>developit</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@ksylor\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>ksylor</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Dang, all this time, I could’ve gone frameworkless</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110969975431692057",
			"parentId": "110969732502280831",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/110969975431692057",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-29T00:04:07.386Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jkohlmann\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jkohlmann</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@ksylor\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>ksylor</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@developit\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>developit</span></a></span> objection!!! Permission to treat as a hostile witness 😅</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110972815410810078",
			"parentId": "110968012104388814",
			"url": "https://mastodon.xyz/@remotesynth/110972815372249352",
			"author": {
				"name": "Brian Rinaldi",
				"url": "https://mastodon.xyz/@remotesynth",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/293/454/870/726/204/original/b2591f5bf2bcee44.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-29T12:06:21.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Right, both options have risks. I think many framework authors moved in the funded direction because of the risks of being independent (i.e. minimal funding combined with high demand for resources). Funding solves the resources issue, but adds the risk of return on investment (i.e. monetize, get bought or go out of business). I'm obviously not saying anything you don't know, but, point is, the risk from an end user's perspective is probably similar (the project is no longer maintained)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110972837833622090",
			"parentId": "110972815410810078",
			"url": "https://mastodon.xyz/@remotesynth/110972837779394674",
			"author": {
				"name": "Brian Rinaldi",
				"url": "https://mastodon.xyz/@remotesynth",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/293/454/870/726/204/original/b2591f5bf2bcee44.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-29T12:12:03.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> The problem for end-users right now is there are few alternatives. Eleventy is independent, but Next/Svelte are under Vercel (I know the structure is different), Gatsby is Netlify, Astro is VC funded. Essentially these all come with \"preferred vendors\" whether it's acknowledged or not. Not that end users are innocent in the equation. The demands we've put on framework authors have, in my opinion, almost forced them to seek funding.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110972987229111896",
