			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.xyz/@remotesynth\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>remotesynth</span></a></span> Yeah, this all seems accurate to me. The one weird piece is that the risk to authors is fairly well known (to authors) but the risk to app developers (end users/framework consumers) is not.</p>",
